# Issue #530: the second consecutive entry into Deferred recomputed the same
# blackboard-populate fingerprint over a freshly wiped blackboard, so every
# pass's Setup() read empty handles and the whole graph culled (a blank frame,
# no GL error). The original switched paths with no frame in between; the
# harness renders settle frames after each operation, so this is the
# rendered-between variant. The no-frame variant stays pinned by
# DeferredOccludedInstanceFieldScene.ReenteringDeferredPathDoesNotCullEntireGraph_Issue530.
